        {
          "id": "region-edermath-orchard",
          "name": "Edermath Orchard",
          "description": "This beautiful orchard is tended by the Edermath family, a quiet half-elven clan who claim their ancestors planted the original trees centuries ago. The orchard miraculously survived the downfall of the previous settlement and was reclaimed from the wild by the family. They cultivate exceptionally crisp, tart apples and produce a famously potent cider that is a favorite at the Sleeping Giant tavern. The grove is known for its serene, almost unnaturally peaceful atmosphere.",
          "type": "Orchard",
