        {
          "id": "region-sleeping-giant",
          "name": "Sleeping Giant",
          "description": "Named for the massive, dormant mountain peak visible from its front door, this ale house is Gelwood's rowdiest establishment. Run by a boisterous and sharp-witted retired sellsword named Grelka, it is the favored haunt of prospectors, trappers, and traders. The air is thick with pipe smoke, the smell of spilled ale, and the sound of tall tales being spun. The 'Giant's Brew,' a dark and deceptively strong ale, is the tavern's signature drink and the cause of many morning regrets.",
          "type": "Ale House",
