        {
          "id": "region-smithy",
          "name": "Smithy",
          "description": "The constant, rhythmic clang of a hammer on steel is the heartbeat of Gelwood, emanating from this open-air smithy built into the sturdy foundation of an old watchtower. The smith is a powerfully built and taciturn woman named Brynn. She specializes in crafting and repairing the tools of the trade: sharp axes, durable pickaxes, and reliable shovel heads. While she can mend a sword or forge a helmet, her true passion lies in creating practical, long-lasting tools for the hardworking folk of the town.",
          "type": "Smithy",
