        {
          "id": "region-stonehill-inn",
          "name": "Stonehill Inn",
          "description": "As the only inn in Gelwood, Stonehill provides a much-needed respite for weary travelers and a quieter social hub for the locals. It is run by a warm and welcoming halfling couple, Erion and Miri Stonehill. The rooms are modest but always impeccably clean, and Miri's hearty rabbit stew is renowned along the Ronceval Road. The common room, with its crackling hearth, is a more family-friendly alternative to the Sleeping Giant, offering warm meals and softer conversation.",
          "type": "Inn",
